{"case": "P02", "request": {"session_id": "cs-24c2c9ed-028e-428e-8efa-ccdb294fa0b0", "runtime_user_id": "U1001", "runtime_nickname": "张三", "runtime_member_level": "gold", "runtime_risk_level": "low", "user_message": "先问一下，帐篷怎么清洗收纳？\n\n[荒野户外商城页面上下文] 当前页面=HOME; 以上上下文已由电商后端校验归属。", "reasoning_view": "off", "debug": false, "runtime_context": {"riskLevel": "low", "afterSaleDraft": {"valid": false, "submitted": false, "stage": "none", "version": "0", "ownerVerified": true}, "memberLevel": "gold", "mobile": "13800001001", "userId": "U1001", "userMessage": "先问一下，帐篷怎么清洗收纳？", "currentUserOrders": [{"orderNo": "ORD9801", "userId": "U1001", "status": "PAID_PENDING_SHIPMENT", "paymentStatus": "PAID", "fulfillmentStatus": "UNSHIPPED", "totalAmount": 200.0, "createdAt": "2026-10-17T12:07:04.533353", "paidAt": "2026-10-17T12:07:04.533353", "itemSummary": ["隔离露营椅"], "items": [{"productName": "隔离露营椅", "quantity": 1, "returnableAtPurchase": true, "returnable": true}], "returnableAtPurchase": true, "returnabilityStatus": "returnable", "returnable": true}, {"orderNo": "ORD9802", "userId": "U1001", "status": "PAID_PENDING_SHIPMENT", "paymentStatus": "PAID", "fulfillmentStatus": "UNSHIPPED", "totalAmount": 200.0, "createdAt": "2026-10-17T12:06:04.537028", "paidAt": "2026-10-17T12:06:04.537028", "itemSummary": ["隔离露营椅"], "items": [{"productName": "隔离露营椅", "quantity": 1, "returnableAtPurchase": true, "returnable": true}], "returnableAtPurchase": true, "returnabilityStatus": "returnable", "returnable": true}], "cancelledAfterSaleDraft": false, "nickname": "张三", "mallAfterSaleRouting": true, "currentUserOrdersTruncated": true, "currentPage": "HOME"}, "history_messages": []}, "response": {"session_id": "cs-24c2c9ed-028e-428e-8efa-ccdb294fa0b0", "answer": "帐篷的清洗和收纳，可以按下面几步来做：\n\n1. **出发前先试搭**：找合适的位置把帐篷搭起来，核对配件是否齐全、搭建步骤是否顺畅，这样能提前发现问题。\n2. **使用后先清杂物**：把帐篷上的砂土、树叶等杂物清理干净。\n3. **按说明书清洁**：具体清洁方式以您这款帐篷的说明书为准。通用养护建议是不要用洗衣机或烘干机强力清洗，以免损伤涂层和面料。\n4. **充分晾干再收纳**：一定要等帐篷完全干透后再收起来。长期潮湿收纳容易产生霉味，也可能影响涂层。\n\n另外提醒一下：如果帐篷出现霉味、脱胶或拉链卡顿，可能和存放条件、使用环境等多种因素有关。方便的话可以告诉我首次出现的时间、存放环境和异常位置，我再帮您进一步判断。\n\n以上是通用的帐篷养护建议，您这款帐篷的具体清洁方式和注意事项，还是以随附说明书和商品页说明为准。", "citations": [{"source": "knowledge/product_knowledge.md", "title": "荒野户外商品选购、使用与问题排查指南", "snippet": "### 3.3 清洁、收纳与首次检查\n\n出发前在合适位置试搭，核对配件和搭建步骤。使用后先清除砂土和杂物，依说明书清洁并充分晾干再收纳；长期潮湿收纳可能带来霉味和涂层问题。通用帐篷养护建议不使用洗衣机或烘干机强洗，具体型号仍以厂商说明为准。[通用依据：REI 帐篷养护](https://www.rei.com/learn/expert-advice/caring-tent.html)。\n\n霉味、脱胶或拉链卡顿可能与不同因素有关，首次出现时间、存放条件与异常位置有助于核验；单张照片不能独立确定责任。", "score": 0.9, "retrieval_stage": "pre_retrieval", "metadata": {"rule_issues": [], "policy_id": "outdoor_product_guide", "scene_key": "product_knowledge", "version": "2026-10-17.1", "publication_status": "published", "effective_from": "2025-01-01T00:00:00+08:00", "effective_to": "2028-01-01T00:00:00+08:00", "snapshot_version": "knowledge-669e2fc4af88", "rule_id": "tent_care", "rule_topics": ["tent_care"], "required_rules": ["product_scope"], "scope": "mall_demo", "rule_sources": [{"source": "knowledge/product_knowledge.md", "policy_id": "outdoor_product_guide", "version": "2026-10-17.1"}], "section_id": "tent_care", "section": "### 3.3 清洁、收纳与首次检查", "answer_topic": "tent_care"}}, {"source": "knowledge/product_knowledge.md", "title": "荒野户外商品选购、使用与问题排查指南", "snippet": "## 1. 适用范围\n\n本指南提供通用选购、使用与问题排查知识。具体型号的参数、配件和使用条件以说明书及可信商品资料为准；通用指南不证明具体商品的价格、库存、活动资格或订单可退资格。\n\n商品名称不能代替承重、防水等级、容量、续航或睡袋温标等参数。型号资料没有公布的数字，当前无法确认。", "score": 0.9, "retrieval_stage": "pre_retrieval", "metadata": {"rule_issues": [], "policy_id": "outdoor_product_guide", "scene_key": "product_knowledge", "version": "2026-10-17.1", "publication_status": "published", "effective_from": "2025-01-01T00:00:00+08:00", "effective_to": "2028-01-01T00:00:00+08:00", "snapshot_version": "knowledge-669e2fc4af88", "rule_id": "product_scope", "rule_topics": ["product_scope"], "required_rules": [], "scope": "mall_demo", "rule_sources": [{"source": "knowledge/product_knowledge.md", "policy_id": "outdoor_product_guide", "version": "2026-10-17.1"